WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:04,800
Damn it, the weather is already over ten degrees below zero.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,820
The roads will probably be blocked by ice tomorrow

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:15,960
How can I still go to work?

4
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:17,160
Why did it suddenly snow so heavily?

5
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,440
The weather forecast didn't say anything either.

6
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:19,680
I woke up from the cold in the middle of the night

7
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:21,280
Get up quickly and turn on the air conditioner. Stop talking.

8
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,240
The heating effect of this broken air conditioner in our house is not good.

9
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,560
It’s been getting colder and colder for half a day

10
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:26,840
I don’t know how long this cold weather will last.

11
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:28,640
I haven’t bought the hot pot lamp clothes yet.

12
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:45,220
Why did Zhang Yi call me so early in the morning?

13
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:46,740
It's so cold outside

14
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:49,660
Before you stocked up on supplies, did you know in advance that the temperature would drop significantly?

15
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:51,460
I also heard it mentioned casually by a friend.

16
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:53,180
No wonder you hoarded so many things

17
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:54,820
Zhang Yi, you are also true

18
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:56,660
But I didn’t expect the temperature to drop so drastically.
